SUMMARY:20s and 30s World Cup Warmup @ Wachusett
LOCATION:Unnamed Roa\nPrinceton\, MA 01541
DESCRIPTION:Sunday\, July 19\, 2026 | 12:00 PM\nhttps://activities.outdoor
 s.org/s/oc-activity/a5UVX000001D3fR2AS/\nJoin us for a short walk along cr
 ows hill where we will have great views of Leominster State Forest.  We w
 ill hike 2-3 miles with a total elevation gain of about 500 ft. After the 
 hike\, anyone who is interested can make the 10 minute drive to the Wachus
 ett Mountain Ski area to watch the FIFA world cup finals at a free public 
 watch party. The trails will include sections of moderate terrain and we w
 ill be moving at a moderate pace. Proper equipment will be required for th
 is hike\, including: hiking and weather appropriate clothing (non-cotton l
 ayers\, hat and mittens\, etc)\, sturdy hiking sneakers or boots\, water\,
  and snacks. 
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:a5UVX000001BgY12AK
SEQUENCE:0
